<!-- 
1. Setup Home → Education Cloud Setup checklist → Set Up Pulse Checks → confirm status On.
2. Setup → Quick Find → discovery → Feature Settings → Discovery Framework → Assessments → General Settings → confirm Discovery Framework = Enabled.
On the same General Settings page, confirm Enable Import/Export of Assessments = Enabled.
Setup → Quick Find → Assessment Settings → confirm External User Assessments = Enabled.

3. Setup --> Care Plan Settings --> Turn On
4. Setup --> Guided Setup --> Action Plan --> Complete Tasks
5. Sharing Settings --> Action Plan and Care Plan --> Public Read only

1.	Create Pulse Check template with omniscript(assessment)
2.	Create Pulse check (Occurrence must be populated - At least 1)
3.	Create Assessment envelope 
    a.	*Make sure to add Contact, LearnerCaseId and Usage Type (Pulse Check) — it will display under the case
4.	Add assessment envelope item and it will display in the portal - make sure start date and end date are populated properly

Debug -
5.	If status says closed then, check envelope item status - should not be “Not started”.
6. Set pulic read only for Action Plan Template in Sharing Settings
!-->
